                  "icon": "",
                  "items": [],
                  "fullText": "What if I already have my own garage? You can choose supply-only and have the engine delivered to your chosen garage. The supplier will provide the engine; your garage handles the fitting."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Do I need to tell the DVLA and my insurer?",
                  "text": "Do I need to tell the DVLA and my insurer? DVLA - update the engine number on your V5C registration document [DVLA, 2025]. Insurer - you should check with your insurer to ensure proper policy coverage after major mechanical replacements.",
